entries:
When work's finally over...{VAR BE01}
When my thrown Poké Ball rocks three
times and I hear that great “click"...{VAR BE01}
My life is full of things that give me joy!

Busy, busy!{VAR BE01}
After I eat breakfast, I have to think
about lunch.{VAR BE01}
After eating lunch, I worry about dinner.
Every day's the same. What a busy life!

...Grumble, grumble, grumble.{VAR BE01}
Should I change my Pokémon's moves,
or should I change my Pokémon?{VAR BE01}
Grumble, grumble...

Castelia City has so many people!{VAR BE01}
Sometimes there are people who are only
interested in themselves.
